            <h3>Compliance is the floor, not the ceiling</h3>
            <p>A service can pass every WCAG checkpoint and still be exhausting to use for someone with ADHD, dyslexia or an anxiety disorder. Roughly one in seven people is neurodivergent, and most digital services exclude them by accident rather than intent — through visual noise, unpredictable navigation and cognitive overload.</p>
            <p>This site is built the way we recommend: the accessibility panel in the corner adjusts text size, contrast, spacing, motion and typeface, and it works without JavaScript frameworks or a cookie banner. Try it.</p>
